le is reviewed.','银行政策、来源许可、代表权限、最终 QA 及发布权限尚未确认。EDD 适用性保留未知，需另行复核风险理由。')}</p><p class="small">SRC-009 / IA v0.4 · SRC-010 / Discussion 2 · SRC-007 / Process Map. ${L('Pain points are hypotheses, not measured bank facts.','痛点为假设，不是已测量的银行事实。')}</p></details></section>${footer()}</main>`;}
